"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4409080","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4216610","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:01Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4216610,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4216610","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:01Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4216610,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4216610","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:01Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4216610,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4216610-1847286114039660","game_id":"steam-4216610","kind":"announcement","title":"Join us for community matches this weekend","summary":"Summoning All Mages!With Steam Next Fest wrapping up, I'd love to get some community matches going this weekend.Join us on the Spellfall Discord at 3:00 PM ET on both Saturday (10/24/26) and Sunday (10/25/26) and let's get some live PvP matches in the arena.Whether you've played the demo already or are jumping in for the first time, everyone is welcome.See you in the arena, mages!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:49:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039660","verified_at":"2026-10-24T16:13:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4216610-1846651706690643","game_id":"steam-4216610","kind":"announcement","title":"Spellfall: Mages and Mayhem Joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Spellfall: Mages and Mayhem joins the October Steam Next Fest! Jump into the demo today! What's Included in the Demo?6 Player Arena Battles: Compete across seven rounds of fast-paced PvP combat, drafting new spells and items between rounds to build your ultimate mage.40 Spells: Experiment with different combinations and discover powerful synergies.30 Items: Customize your build with equipment that compliment your spells and playstyle.6 Arenas: Battle in different environments as the arena crumbl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690643","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4216610-1845383656389754","game_id":"steam-4216610","kind":"announcement","title":"Spellfall Has a New Name!","summary":"Spellfall: Last Mage Standing is now Spellfall: Mages & Mayhem.The name may be changing, but the game is not. Spellfall is still the same fast-paced arena brawler where up to six mages draft powerful spells and items, battle through seven rounds, and try to come out on top as the arena crumbles beneath their feet. The new name puts the focus right where it belongs: on the chaotic arena battles at the heart of Spellfall.The new branding is now live on the Steam store, along with an updated traile","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T18:41:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4216610-1842846814452118","game_id":"steam-4216610","kind":"update","title":"September 2026 Spellfall Update","summary":"It's been another busy month for Spellfall! With the October Steam Next Fest quickly approaching, much of this past month has focused on expanding the ways you play, improving build options, and implementing some fantastic play tester suggestions. Here's what's changed since the August update! Two Additional Combat RoundsSpellfall matches have been expanded from five rounds to seven giving players more opportunities to battle with their completed builds.After drafting your final ability and item","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T03:51:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452118","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4216610-1839676055892902","game_id":"steam-4216610","kind":"update","title":"August 2026 Spellfall Update","summary":"It's been a little over a month since the Spellfall demo launched, and I'd like to first thank everyone that's jumped in to play the game and share their feedback.I've been hard at work implementing your suggestions and adding new content. Here's what's new in this month's update!Two New BiomesThe arena has expanded with two new battleground biomes, adding more variety to your Spellfall matches.Complete Item OverhaulThe item system has been redesigned from the ground up. Items now have a stronge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T16:04:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892902","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4216610-1835871199316004","game_id":"steam-4216610","kind":"announcement","title":"The Spellfall Demo is now available!","summary":"Draft spells, cast powerful magic, and outlast rival mages as the arena crumbles beneath your feet.What's included?• 5 full practice matches vs. bots • Access to all spells, items, and arena biomes • Mage level progression and cosmetic rewards that carry over to the full gameWant more Spellfall?Join the Discord for online matchmaking, team modes, and community playtests.If you enjoy the demo, please consider wishlisting and following Spellfall on Steam to stay up to date as development continues","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T16:03:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316004","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4216610-1834602721188483","game_id":"steam-4216610","kind":"announcement","title":"A Year in the Arena","summary":"One year ago I began development on what would eventually become Spellfall: Last Mage Standing. I set out with the intention of creating an arena brawler that would be fun to play solo or with friends, both casually or competitively. Inspired by some of my favorite games and mods from over the years, I wanted to bring more modern controls and action combat to some classic concepts while also focusing on free-for-all matches and round-based build drafting instead of fixed champions and nonstop te","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T18:42:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721188483","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4216610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4216610":"2026-10-26T11:45:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4216610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:31Z"},"4409080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:32Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4216610","app_id":4216610,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"11009aba45468891d2be6eb7cf70b2900de408e6d0b604f9dd460c10fecbedf4","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A fast-paced, top-down PvP arena brawler where up to six mages compete across seven rounds of magical mayhem. Draft new spells and items between rounds, create increasingly powerful builds, and outlast your opponents as the arena crumbles beneath your feet.","publishers":[{"name":"Chain Five Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Chain Five Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794931200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Spellfall: Mages & Mayhem Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790818478","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4216610/286299369/2e36afd218c06077404760b28333911a01b75424/1790564776/microtrailer.webm","type":"vi